Cross: 13t u = 20x̂ + a(26u - 24x̂). In basis (x̂, u): 13t u = 20x̂ + 26a u - 24a x̂ = (20-24a)x̂ + 26a u. Since x̂, u independent: 0 = 20 - 24a → a = 5/6. 13t = 26a = 26·5/6 = 65/3 → t = 65/39 = 5/3 > 1. So intersection at t=5/3 outside AF. No crossing in true config. Good — figure not to scale.

Check FN vs EM in true config: FN: F + a(N-F) = 13u + a(40x̂ - 78u) = 40a x̂ + (13-78a)u. EM: 20x̂ + b(26u - 24x̂) = (20-24b)x̂ + 26b u. Equate: 40a = 20-24b; 13-78a = 26b. From first: 24b = 20-40a → b = (20-40a)/24 = (5-10a)/6. Substitute: 13 - 78a = 26(5-10a)/6 = (13/3)(5-10a) = 65/3 - 130a/3. Multiply 3: 39 - 234a = 65 - 130a → -104a = 26 → a = -1/4. Outside. Good.

Check FN vs CE: FN: 40a x̂ + (13-78a)u. CE: C + b(E - C) = 91u + b(20x̂ - 91u) = 20b x̂ + 91(1-b)u. Equate: 40a = 20b → b = 2a. 13 - 78a = 91(1-2a) = 91 - 182a → 104a = 78 → a = 3/4, b = 3/2 > 1. Outside segment CE. Good.

Check FN vs other edges: FN vs BC: BC: 28x̂ + b(91u - 28x̂)... B=28x̂, C=91u. BC: 28x̂ + b(91u - 28x̂) = 28(1-b)x̂ + 91b u. FN: 40a x̂ + (13-78a)u. Equate: 40a = 28(1-b), 13-78a = 91b. From first b = 1 - 10a/7. Then 13 - 78a = 91 - 130a → 52a = 78 → a = 3/2 >1. Outside.

Check MA vs others: MA: M + a(A - M) = (26u - 4x̂)(1-a). MA vs NB: NB: N + b(B - N) = (40x̂ - 65u) + b(-12x̂ + 65u) = (40-12b)x̂ + (-65+65b)u. MA: (1-a)(-4)x̂ + 26(1-a)u. Equate: -4(1-a) = 40 - 12b; 26(1-a) = -65 + 65b. From second: 1-a = (-65+65b)/26 = (5b-5)/2 → a = 1 - (5b-5)/2 = (7-5b)/2. From first: 1-a = (40-12b)/(-4) = 3b - 10 → a = 11 - 3b. Set equal: (7-5b)/2 = 11 - 3b → 7 - 5b = 22 - 6b → b = 15. Outside.

MA vs CE: MA: (1-a)(26u - 4x̂). CE: 20b x̂ + 91(1-b)u. Equate: -4(1-a) = 20b → 1-a = -5b → a = 1+5b. 26(1-a) = 91(1-b) → 26(-5b) = 91 - 91b → -130b = 91 - 91b → -39b = 91 → b = -7/3. Outside.

MA vs NB done. MA vs BC: BC: 28(1-b)x̂ + 91b u. MA: -4(1-a)x̂ + 26(1-a)u. Equate: -4(1-a) = 28(1-b) → 1-a = -7(1-b) = 7b - 7. 26(1-a) = 91b → 26(7b-7) = 91b → 182b - 182 = 91b → 91b = 182 → b = 2. Outside.

MA vs FN: MA: (1-a)(26u - 4x̂) = -4(1-a)x̂ + 26(1-a)u. FN: 40a x̂ + (13-78a)u. Equate: -4(1-a) = 40a → -4 + 4a = 40a → a = -1/9. Outside.

AF vs NB: AF: 13t u. NB: (40-12b)x̂ + (-65+65b)u. Equate: 0 = 40-12b → b = 10/3 >1. Outside.

AF vs BC: 13t u = 28(1-b)x̂ + 91b u → 0 = 28(1-b) → b=1, then 13t = 91 → t = 7. Outside.

AF vs CE: 13t u = 20b x̂ + 91(1-b)u → 0 = 20b → b = 0 → 13t = 91 → t = 7. Outside.

