Sampling every 1/8 second → 8 samples per second. 16 states → 4 bits per sample. Rate = 8 × 4 = 32 b/s.</think>**Setting up the problem:**

- The channel samples once every 1/8 second, so the sampling rate is 8 samples per second (baud rate = 8 baud).
