Also by law of cosines, side $A_iA_{i+1}$: $s_i^2 = a_i^2 + a_{i+1}^2 - 2 a_i a_{i+1} (12/13) = a_i^2 + a_{i+1}^2 - 24/5$ (since $a_i a_{i+1} = 26/5$, times 24/13 = 48/5... wait: 2·(26/5)·(12/13) = 2·26·12/(5·13) = 624/65 = 48/5). So $s_i^2 = a_i^2 + a_{i+1}^2 - 48/5$.

Perimeter: sum of $s_i$ for i=2..10 plus $a_2 + a_{11}$ = 20.

